WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:39.820
[Abyss]

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.210
Are you together?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:07.810
Wake him up.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.210
Sir, wake up.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:16.829
Sir.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.240
Who is it?

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:55.520
[Episode 6]

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.520
[Huangzhiyuan Hotel]

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:07.200
My poor little brother!

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.750
You lost your life working here!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.930
Laifu!

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.490
Laifu's sister, look.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.240
Song Laifu was indeed
an employee of our hotel—

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.030
there's no doubt about that.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.930
But he died outside the hotel,

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:22.750
and as for how he died,

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.430
even the police
haven't figured it out yet.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.180
So what good is it to come to us?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.960
My Laifu!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.790
Now that you're dead,
they're refusing to take responsibility!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.730
Laifu's sister.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.000
This is a little something

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.060
from all of us hotel employees.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:43.900
We managed to put together 8,000 yuan,

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.190
and I added another 1,500.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.320
So that makes 10,000 in total.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.090
It's just a small token of our sympathy.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:47.910
Please take it. Take it.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.680
We're all just employees here too.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.300
Look, there's really no need
to make things difficult for us,

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:51.970
right?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.500
10,000 yuan for a life?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.640
Have you no conscience?

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.269
Stop playing the instruments!
Stop playing!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.300
Is that Song Jindi

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.370
really Song Laifu's biological sister?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:27.110
Yes.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.060
I've confirmed it with the police.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.360
But apart from Song Jindi,

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.370
all those so-called distant relatives

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.430
are just villagers from his hometown.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.690
They have no blood relation to him at all.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.540
I'd guess Song Jindi paid them
to come here.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.180
Chief Wang hasn't sent anyone over yet?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.480
Not yet.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.510
In my opinion,

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.570
these people just have nothing to lose.

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:51.500
We might as well just ask Si

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.560
to bring in some real tough guys

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.890
and just take care of them
once and for all.

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:56.540
Otherwise,

00:04:56.909 --> 00:04:59.970
we'll just have to shell out some money
as compensation

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.910
and call it a day.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.010
We can't get Si on this.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.540
He doesn't know when to stop.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.800
He could turn this into a major bloodbath.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.980
At a time like this,

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:14.360
we've actually let those country bumpkins
get the upper hand.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.900
How much do you think they're asking for?

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.890
Judging by the situation, probably

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.370
200,000 or 300,000 yuan.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.160
They sure dare to dream.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.120
Song Laifu's salary was only
1,500 yuan a month.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.040
Could he ever have saved that much
in his entire lifetime?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.300
They're definitely asking for
an exorbitant sum.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.680
But what can we do?
There's no way around it.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.070
And things are especially sensitive
right now.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.750
We can't let this

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.620
affect the launch of Huangshui Jiayuan,
can we?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.480
That's the most important thing.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:44.620
So if

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.130
throwing some money at it
can make the trouble go away,

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.240
then I guess that's what we have to do.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.570
What do you think, Boss?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.150
150,000 yuan.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.250
Not a penny more.

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.320
Tell them to take it or leave it.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.530
Alright, I'll go negotiate.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.990
Let me tell you something.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.800
Once this is over

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.760
and the heat dies down,

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:06.000
make sure whoever takes that money
knows one thing:

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.380
my money

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.900
isn't that easy to take.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:09.800
Got it.

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:34.640
Why are you here?

00:06:34.659 --> 00:06:36.110
A fight broke out over there.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:36.740
Let them fight.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:37.250
Don't get involved.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.780
Let's go. Come on, let's go.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.220
Listen to me.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.810
Just wait for me in this room.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.050
I'll be done in an hour at most,

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.650
then we'll go home together.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.340
Help yourself to the fruit.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.220
I still have work to do.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.470
Just don't go wandering off, okay?

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.180
Mom.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.090
Don't go anywhere near the fight.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.300
You might get hurt by accident.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.190
Don't worry.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.250
I'll stay far, far away.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.310
I'm pretty quick on my feet, you know.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:01.220
Just don't go running off.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:01.860
Okay.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.260
Check if the spot where I got hit bruised?

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.130
Not really.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.010
It's just red.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.450
The village choir was truly ruthless.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.450
We've offered that much money,

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.690
and yet they still attacked me—
and they really went all out.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.090
How much did Mr. Li offer?

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.360
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.270
Where were you when the choir

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.120
was beating me up?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.180
I was right behind you the whole time.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.510
Li Cheng?

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.240
Why are you here?

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.810
I'm waiting for my mom to get off work.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.159
I'm not breaking any of your rules, am I?

00:07:34.159 --> 00:07:35.240
There are no rules.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.040
Come on, sit.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.650
I'm the one in charge here.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:38.530
Have an apple.

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:39.650
No, thanks.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:41.600
Li Cheng.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:43.830
It's me.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.370
SN.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.330
Can't recognize me in my work uniform?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.010
This is the best AD in our group,

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:50.690
SN.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:52.950
SN?

00:07:53.159 --> 00:07:55.370
Didn't expect me to be
a lowly security guard, huh?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.970
What do you mean lowly?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.130
Is being a security guard beneath you?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.490
How do you two know each other?

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.560
We played video games together

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.070
at an internet café.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.010
Cheng.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.560
Your mom works at this hotel?

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.070
Yes.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.300
Which one is she? Do I know her?

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.300
Why do you have so many questions?

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.040
Don't you have anything better to do?

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.240
Get back to your post.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.560
I just sat down
and you're already kicking me out.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.620
I thought I'd help you up the stairs

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.170
so I could read my novel for a bit.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:29.870
Still trying to read that novel?

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.800
Aren't you supposed to be working?

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:32.360
I am, I am.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.360
I am, alright?

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.220
Talk to you later.

00:08:39.409 --> 00:08:40.320
SN.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:43.179
Don't tell anyone here
that I went to the internet cafe.

00:08:43.179 --> 00:08:44.790
My mom doesn't like me playing games.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.330
I don't want her to find out.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:47.280
Okay.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.650
Hey, put that back!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:54.530
Look at this guy.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:56.200
I never should've brought in

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.870
all these pirated books—

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.340
cultivation novels,
magic books, all that stuff.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.460
Now none of them want to work.

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.260
They just sit here and slack off.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.410
He's one of them,

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:06.840
and there's also Wu,

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:07.790
as well as Song.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.580
Though I probably shouldn't have said that
about Song.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.850
The dead deserve our respect.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:13.820
My bad. My bad.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:17.900
Song also used to come to this lounge
quite often?

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:22.520
Everyone's into those wish-fulfillment
novels these days, aren't they?

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.540
This sofa is way more comfortable
than the guard booth,

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.670
and it's quiet here.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.550
I can understand young people

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:30.360
being into this kind of stuff,

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.790
but Song was already in his fifties.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:32.090
Why was he so interested in time travel?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.390
[The Mountain Lotus Calamity]

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:34.270
Well, now he's really

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.600
traveled through time—

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.780
straight into the afterlife.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.290
It's one thing that he died,

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.190
but he had to leave us
with no peace, either.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.200
Li Cheng.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.550
Didn't you pass the police exam?

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.010
When you have time,
put on that police uniform of yours

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:50.980
and come take a good walk

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.030
around our hotel.

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:54.890
Show your face and scare off
all those evil spirits.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.300
You'll see. This place is

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.550
packed with people, full of trouble,

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.550
and teeming with all kinds of filth.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.740
[Abyss]

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:11.080
What were you talking about
with Zhang Chengguo earlier today?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.870
Nothing, just chatting.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:13.960
I'm telling you,

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.650
stay away from him from now on.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.460
Just be polite

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.680
and keep things civil. That'll be enough.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.560
Why?

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:23.070
That Zhang Chengguo

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.750
is anything but trustworthy.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.320
You saw that crowd
causing a scene downstairs

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.570
when you came up this afternoon, right?

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:30.810
Those were all Song's family members,

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.130
and they were all here to ask Mr. Li
for money.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.410
I recognized the woman leading them

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:36.790
the moment I saw her.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.250
I've seen

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.510
Zhang Chengguo having dinner with her

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.540
at a small restaurant before.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:42.390
I'm telling you,

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.620
Zhang Chengguo must have egged her on

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.350
to come here and cause trouble,

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:47.950
while he played along
from inside the hotel

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:49.850
to pull a fast one on Mr. Li.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.250
That's definitely what was going on.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.620
Take it from me—
I can't be wrong about this.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.520
Mom.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.770
They just had a meal together,

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:57.370
and you deduced all that?

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.320
I'm pretty sharp, you know.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:00.130
Let me tell you,

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.410
if I'd gotten into
the police academy back then,

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.340
I'd at least be doing better
than your Uncle Li is now.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.770
Maybe

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.120
Zhang Chengguo was sent by Li Zhengbin
to negotiate.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.000
They couldn't reach an agreement,

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.000
so the lady came here to make a scene.

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:14.860
That could also be true.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.650
I must criticize you.

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.510
Whose side are you on, anyway?

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.410
Why are you defending him?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.370
Mom.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.670
We're both just making assumptions
right now.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.670
Both scenarios are possible,

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.650
right?

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:37.720
Right.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.580
My son's always right.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:41.420
Absolutely right.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:52.910
Captain Fan.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:55.460
Someone named Li Cheng wants to see you.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.650
He says he has important leads
on the case.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.290
Li Cheng?

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.900
-Is he that one from Huangzhiyuan Hotel...
-Yeah, the son of a cleaner there.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.760
He's one of us.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:04.630
Let him in.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:07.670
This way.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:11.960
Captain Fan.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:12.900
Li Cheng.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.110
Hello.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.030
Hello, gentlemen.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.010
[Huangshui Public Security]

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.410
This is what I found in the staff lounge

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.220
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:20.860
[Abyss]

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.090
"Abyss"?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.000
Is this the one you mentioned?

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:25.690
Written by Han Pinmu.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:25.870
[Huangshui Public Security]

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.870
Not bad.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.370
You even put it in a bag.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.920
Just say what you have to say.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.960
Is this

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:49.090
the package Song Laifu received?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.070
The one where the sender
was listed as Xiaofei?

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:52.960
[Sender: Xiaofei]
[Recipient: Song Laifu]

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:53.950
Could Song Laifu losing his temper
on the phone

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.280
[Recipient: Song Laifu]

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.730
have something to do with this book?

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.870
Could he be a character...

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:02.910
Let's first check

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.790
if there are any differences
from the version online.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.520
We'll discuss the rest of the case
at the meeting.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.250
Okay, thank you.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:11.680
This lead is really valuable.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:13.060
It's my duty.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.490
[Evidence Room]

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.280
Li Cheng.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.370
Do you have time tomorrow?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.770
I think I do.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.320
Come to my place for dinner.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.080
Didn't you tell me to visit less?

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.030
While you're at it,

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.350
t-tutor my daughter.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.980
Why do I feel like

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.550
I was hired as a tenured teacher?

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.170
You...

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.490
Which subject?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.730
Whatever subject you're good at.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.360
You're not even paying me.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.940
You're asking your master for money?

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.500
You admitted it yourself.

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:02.290
So our master-apprentice relationship

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:03.340
is official now.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.870
No organization or leader

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.160
can ever tear us apart.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.940
You little brat.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.510
When you memorize vocabulary,

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:17.860
do you usually look at the word list,

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:20.860
cover the English, and try to
write the English from the Chinese?

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.890
Think about it.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.010
Most English exams are multiple-choice,

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.240
and the essay section doesn't make
that big a difference in your score.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:28.320
If your goal is just to get 120 points,

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.310
I'd suggest covering the Chinese
and reading the English.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.700
As long as you know what the word means,
that's enough.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.150
You don't need to know how to spell it.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.580
That'll help you memorize vocabulary
much faster.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:37.580
That makes sense.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.170
You're so smart.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:41.680
Why don't you go pursue a career
in a big city?

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.380
Other places are, after all,
just other places.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.270
Huangshui is my home.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.750
Such an old-fashioned way of thinking.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:54.700
Besides English,

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.780
is there any other subject
you're having trouble with?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.060
What are you doing?

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.720
He's tutoring her in there.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.050
Why are you eavesdropping at the door?

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.100
Don't you have better things to do?

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.220
I just want to see if that brat
can actually teach.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.950
It's a lot easier than
keeping an eye on suspects.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:18.030
That's your daughter and your apprentice.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:19.170
Why are you talking about suspects?

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.820
I never officially acknowledged him
as my apprentice.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.760
I don't care whether it's official or not.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:25.600
He's a guest I invited.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.890
You need to show some hospitality.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:43.710
Hello?

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.830
I looked over last year's exam.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.430
The format of the essay questions
is fairly consistent.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.550
Personally, I think

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.250
solid geometry is one of
the easier sections to score points on.

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.500
Once you've mastered it,

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.220
the error rate is really low.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.250
Smells so good.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.290
Li Cheng, there's a new clue.

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.240
Come with me.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.100
Now?

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.120
Yeah, right now.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.970
Sorry to interrupt.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.150
Keep studying.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.840
Are you coming back for dinner tonight?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:14.760
Not sure.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:15.790
Don't wait for us.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.060
Master,

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.240
what's so urgent?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.000
Hu Sen tracked down

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.370
the taxi Song Laifu took
on the day he died.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.530
The driver gave us
Song Laifu's destination:

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.620
an abandoned paint factory
outside the city,

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.580
just 2.3 kilometers

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.370
from the scene of his death.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.590
Let's go check it out.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.990
It's official business?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.130
Is it okay for me to go?

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.510
The list from the provincial authorities
has been released.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.690
Once the public notice period ends,

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.940
you'll be a full-fledged police officer.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.620
You're already deeply involved
in this case.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:44.870
Once you're officially on the force,

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.800
I'll bring you onto the task force.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.960
The more you know about the case now,

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.200
the better you'll be able to

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.650
make the right call
when things get dangerous—

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:53.910
and protect yourself.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.720
I'm doing this for your safety.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.599
Can we get in touch with the owner?

00:17:18.599 --> 00:17:19.660
We can't.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.530
The factory went out of business
5 years ago.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.569
The owner owed quite a bit of money

00:17:21.569 --> 00:17:23.180
and isn't living locally anymore.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.220
[Jianlan Paint Factory, Huangshui County]

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:35.650
Captain Zhao.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.540
What is he doing here?

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.330
[Jianlan Paint Factory, Huangshui County]

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:46.250
Hello, sir. I'm Li Cheng.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.180
I'm Hu Sen.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.500
When we had new recruits before,

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:51.800
didn't we usually
bring them into the station

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.590
6 months early to do odd jobs?

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.400
This is a major case.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.770
How can you treat it the same way?

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.350
Well, you see,

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.670
Li Cheng has a real knack
for criminal investigation.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.550
He's very familiar with this case,

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.940
and he's even provided us
with important leads.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.810
He's familiar with the case?
How could he be familiar with it?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.010
Did you violate our discipline?

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.750
No, absolutely not.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.720
Maybe Xin Jiran told him.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.570
He even knows Xin Jiran?

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.790
Then he definitely can't be involved.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.460
Xin Jiran is a suspect now.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.140
So what if he knows him?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.660
We all know him.

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:21.730
Are we all supposed to
stay away from the case?

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.180
I said no, and I mean it.
Tell him to leave.

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:23.720
Fan!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.940
Come on, Captain Fan, do me a favor.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.290
I've already given him my word.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:34.960
From now on,

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:38.480
I'll do whatever you say, okay?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.510
Do you realize how pathetic you look
right now?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.280
Li Cheng, right?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:47.580
Yes, Captain Fan.

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.090
You understand the rules?

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:49.720
Yes.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:50.740
Watch more, do less.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:51.940
No acting on your own.

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:52.770
Yes, sir!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:45.100
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.770
[Qidu City]

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:47.980
Working at heights

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.200
without wearing a safety harness?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.660
Do you all think you're Spider-Man
or something?

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.070
I, Zhang Quan, brought you out here

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:52.830
to make money,

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.900
not to risk your lives!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.200
To put it bluntly,

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:56.680
don't end up earning money
that you won't live long enough to spend.

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:57.640
Got it?

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.070
-Got it.
-Got it.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:19:59.830
Dismissed!

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:06.180
Where's your hard hat?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.380
Which team are you on?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.310
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:14.370
I just need to ask you a few things.

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.010
Do you know Song Laifu?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.010
From 2002 to 2005,

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.670
he worked on your construction crew
for 3 years.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.460
Song Laifu?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:25.480
The name rings a bell,

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:27.450
but I can't put a face to it.

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:28.810
He's from De'ermu City.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.610
He was in his forties at the time.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.740
De'ermu?

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:34.980
De'ermu...

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.050
I think there was such a guy.

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:38.530
I remember

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:39.750
everyone called him "Machine Gun"

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:40.980
because once he started talking,
he just wouldn't stop.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:41.680
Yeah, there was such a guy.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.280
You mean he was a chatterbox?

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.960
But from what I've heard,
he was a man of few words.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.000
No way.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:47.570
I remember

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:48.570
when everyone called him "Machine Gun",

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:49.570
he was pretty happy about it.

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:51.640
He said it sounded
way more badass than "Rifle."

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.770
He was a chatterbox.

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:56.170
Are you... A cop?

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.680
Don't go snooping around.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:58.830
Take a closer look.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.530
Officer, I really can't put a face to him.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.330
I do remember I had a fellow villager

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.840
who was closest to him back then.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:09.620
How about...

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:10.790
Let's go.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:11.940
Wait, wait. Officer, here's the thing.

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:13.940
We have safety regulations here.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.250
You can't wander around
without a hard hat.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.110
How about this?

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.510
You wait for me over there in the shade,

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:20.970
and I'll go get him for you.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.350
Wait, wait. Officer.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.960
Um, if you don't mind me asking,

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:30.890
which police station are you with?

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.770
Don't ask questions
you shouldn't be asking.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:34.500
Alright.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.140
Then... Wait for me here.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:36.830
Don't wander off,

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.330
or I won't be able to find you
when I come back.

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:39.590
I'll go get him for you.

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:44.980
Such a huge factory complex,

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:46.480
and not a soul in sight.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.180
What could Song Laifu have come here for?

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.270
Maybe he was meeting someone?

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:55.440
Or maybe he hid something here.

00:21:55.470 --> 00:21:57.090
If he hid something, then we're in for it.

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:00.090
This place is huge.
Where would we even start looking?

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.500
Did you hear that?

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.610
It's fine. It's on a leash.

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:22.740
It's domesticated.

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:24.630
Is anyone here?

00:22:25.750 --> 00:22:26.740
Is anyone here?

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:30.270
Who are you?

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:31.570
Police.

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:32.570
Police?

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:34.010
What's the matter?

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:35.300
Tie up your dog.

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:36.300
It's attacking people.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:38.960
If you don't tie it up,
we'll have to deal with it.

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:09.810
You can't even control your own dog?

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:12.340
Darn mutt. It's stubborn as hell.

00:23:18.950 --> 00:23:19.950
No need for that.

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:21.070
We just have a few questions for you.

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:22.510
Just answer truthfully.

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:23.470
Have a seat.

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:30.420
Where were you on the 15th of this month?

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:32.680
The 15th?

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:35.230
I was probably in this room.

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:37.270
Usually, except for going out
to buy groceries,

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.440
I don't go anywhere.

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:40.110
Are you the only person
in this entire factory complex?

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:41.920
Yes. Our boss said

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.810
that if he finds the right buyer,

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:45.960
he'll sell the whole factory and the land.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:47.110
He asked me to stay here
and keep an eye on the place.

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:48.330
He pays me 1,500 yuan a month.

00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:51.260
I thought your boss skipped town
owing people money.

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.000
I don't know about that.

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:55.240
He may not be in Huangshui anymore,

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.480
but he's never once failed to pay me.

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:59.610
Maybe he's just fallen on hard times.

00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:02.030
Who knows? He might
make a comeback someday.

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:03.510
You're pretty loyal to him.

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:04.680
I wouldn't call it loyalty.

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:06.090
I'm just a decent guy.

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:07.140
Tell us.

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.200
How do you know Song Laifu?

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:10.350
Who?

00:24:10.350 --> 00:24:13.410
Song Laifu, the security guard
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel.

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:15.610
I don't know him.

00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:16.940
Never even heard of him.

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:23.220
Take a good look.

00:24:23.220 --> 00:24:24.420
Do you recognize him?

00:24:26.750 --> 00:24:27.770
Think carefully.

00:24:28.940 --> 00:24:29.800
Do you know him?

00:24:32.750 --> 00:24:33.710
No, I don't.

00:24:33.790 --> 00:24:34.980
Quit pretending.

00:24:34.980 --> 00:24:36.750
Someone saw him come here to see you.

00:24:36.750 --> 00:24:38.920
I really never saw him.

00:24:43.180 --> 00:24:43.980
What's wrong?

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:46.940
Sen, check out this network cable.

00:24:49.510 --> 00:24:51.270
Think back to that rainy day.

00:24:51.610 --> 00:24:53.810
Any concealment of the truth is a crime.

00:24:53.960 --> 00:24:54.530
I...

00:24:54.790 --> 00:24:57.180
I really never saw him.

00:24:58.830 --> 00:25:00.960
What does your dog usually eat?

00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:02.290
It eats whatever I eat.

00:25:02.290 --> 00:25:03.250
Why does it look like

00:25:03.250 --> 00:25:04.780
it hasn't been fed for days?

00:25:06.010 --> 00:25:07.610
I forgot these past few days.

00:25:15.310 --> 00:25:16.590
Two, three, four.

00:25:18.420 --> 00:25:20.810
It barks at your door all day.
How could you possibly forget?

00:25:20.810 --> 00:25:22.270
Or is this dog

00:25:22.640 --> 00:25:24.480
not even yours?

00:25:24.530 --> 00:25:25.310
Tell us.

00:25:25.310 --> 00:25:26.960
Besides you,

00:25:27.000 --> 00:25:29.200
who else lives in this factory complex?

00:25:31.010 --> 00:25:33.940
-No one else...
-Think carefully before you answer!

00:25:36.240 --> 00:25:36.920
Captain.

00:25:36.920 --> 00:25:39.650
We found a network cable
leading to the back room.

00:25:40.590 --> 00:25:42.140
Well, there is someone living here.

00:25:42.140 --> 00:25:43.750
I charge him 200 yuan for rent
every month.

00:25:43.750 --> 00:25:44.570
But as for what he does

00:25:44.570 --> 00:25:45.290
or what he used to do,

00:25:45.290 --> 00:25:46.940
I really have no idea.

00:26:22.980 --> 00:26:24.030
Hey, I'm talking to you.

00:26:24.030 --> 00:26:25.230
Where's your leader?

00:26:26.900 --> 00:26:27.420
Make way. Make way.

00:26:27.420 --> 00:26:28.620
Where's your leader?

00:26:33.770 --> 00:26:35.170
Come on. He's right here.

00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:36.980
Over there.

00:26:37.050 --> 00:26:38.310
-Stop right there!
-Freeze!

00:26:38.310 --> 00:26:39.550
-Move!
-Stop!

00:26:39.850 --> 00:26:41.030
-Stop!
-Stop!

00:26:41.030 --> 00:26:41.760
Out of my way!

00:26:52.420 --> 00:26:53.310
Freeze!

00:26:54.000 --> 00:26:54.810
Stop there!

00:27:09.110 --> 00:27:10.240
Split up and search!

00:27:20.550 --> 00:27:21.350
Stop!

00:27:28.480 --> 00:27:29.680
Catch him! Catch him!

00:27:29.940 --> 00:27:31.050
Don't let him get away!

00:27:31.050 --> 00:27:31.870
He's a fraud!

00:27:31.870 --> 00:27:32.880
[Construction Site]

00:27:32.880 --> 00:27:34.140
Stop him! Stop him!

00:27:35.700 --> 00:27:36.610
Catch him!

00:27:36.610 --> 00:27:37.720
Don't let him get away!

00:27:37.720 --> 00:27:38.720
He's a fraud!

00:27:38.720 --> 00:27:39.550
Move!

00:27:39.550 --> 00:27:40.510
Stop him!

00:27:40.510 --> 00:27:41.680
Stop him right now!

00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:42.720
Get out of the way!

00:27:45.110 --> 00:27:46.010
After him!

00:27:52.610 --> 00:27:54.010
-Stop!
-Freeze!

00:27:54.440 --> 00:27:54.860
Stop!

00:27:54.890 --> 00:27:55.890
Stop right there!

00:28:38.180 --> 00:28:39.840
There's an office over there.

00:28:39.880 --> 00:28:41.180
He lives in that room.

00:29:00.960 --> 00:29:01.660
[Chemical Storage Area]

00:29:09.460 --> 00:29:13.180
[Chemical Storage Area]

00:29:13.180 --> 00:29:14.030
Hu?

00:29:14.880 --> 00:29:16.110
Hu, are you in there?

00:29:16.530 --> 00:29:17.460
Hu?

00:29:41.620 --> 00:29:42.750
Call the station.

00:30:09.400 --> 00:30:12.140
It's dated 2008.

00:30:15.420 --> 00:30:16.690
His ID.

00:30:17.380 --> 00:30:19.060
[Name: Hu Xiaofei]

00:30:19.360 --> 00:30:20.620
Take a picture of this.

00:30:22.810 --> 00:30:23.590
Zhao,

00:30:24.430 --> 00:30:25.200
come here.

00:30:28.810 --> 00:30:31.530
See if this is the one
who died 8 years ago.

00:30:31.550 --> 00:30:32.820
Bi Dehua?

00:30:36.240 --> 00:30:36.960
Li Cheng.

00:30:40.160 --> 00:30:41.100
You said

00:30:41.130 --> 00:30:42.530
you saw a photo at Han Pinmu's place

00:30:42.530 --> 00:30:44.460
with part of it torn off, right?

00:30:45.090 --> 00:30:45.940
Take a look.

00:30:46.700 --> 00:30:49.310
Does the background match this part?

00:30:59.980 --> 00:31:01.180
It looks a bit like it.

00:31:01.400 --> 00:31:03.350
The photo I saw at Han Pinmu's place

00:31:03.350 --> 00:31:05.410
was also taken on a basketball court.

00:31:06.850 --> 00:31:09.110
Did you ever hear Han Pinmu mention

00:31:10.050 --> 00:31:11.510
the name Hu Xiaofei?

00:31:13.400 --> 00:31:14.110
No.

00:31:29.420 --> 00:31:32.180
[2004]

00:31:41.460 --> 00:31:43.830
Dehua, can't you go easy on me?

00:31:43.850 --> 00:31:45.570
I want to tell you this way

00:31:45.600 --> 00:31:47.240
that you have no talent for basketball.

00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:49.570
Go back and study your academic subjects.

00:31:55.410 --> 00:31:57.110
[Bi Dehua]

00:32:02.690 --> 00:32:04.220
[Victim No. 4]
[Du Juan, Han Pinmu's Stepmother]

00:32:04.250 --> 00:32:05.460
[Xin Jiran (Reason for Imprisonment)]

00:32:05.490 --> 00:32:07.730
[Bi Dehua]

00:32:12.730 --> 00:32:16.310
[Bi Dehua] [Feiyang]

00:32:23.830 --> 00:32:24.720
Try these on.

00:32:26.140 --> 00:32:27.220
I'm not nearsighted.

00:32:27.220 --> 00:32:28.410
Why give me glasses?

00:32:28.690 --> 00:32:30.290
They don't even have lenses.

00:32:31.010 --> 00:32:33.400
It's called fashion.
It's all about the look,

00:32:33.400 --> 00:32:34.310
you know?

00:32:34.740 --> 00:32:36.670
These are imported from overseas.

00:32:42.060 --> 00:32:42.870
Do I look good?

00:32:42.900 --> 00:32:44.100
Quite handsome.

00:32:44.390 --> 00:32:46.730
You've got a bit of
Takeshi Kaneshiro's vibe.

00:32:46.730 --> 00:32:47.910
Seriously?

00:32:59.340 --> 00:33:00.320
Stop fixing it.

00:33:00.350 --> 00:33:01.530
Once I start working,

00:33:01.530 --> 00:33:02.730
I'll get you a new one.

00:33:04.510 --> 00:33:06.400
By the time you finish college,
get your master's,

00:33:06.400 --> 00:33:08.140
and then your PhD,

00:33:08.200 --> 00:33:09.660
10 years will have passed.

00:33:11.160 --> 00:33:13.160
I'm not getting a master's or a PhD.

00:33:13.420 --> 00:33:14.570
I'm just going to college

00:33:14.570 --> 00:33:17.030
so I can give my mom an answer
and call it a day.

00:33:18.900 --> 00:33:20.420
You love music so much.

00:33:20.590 --> 00:33:23.050
Maybe I should go to
a music academy instead.

00:33:23.270 --> 00:33:25.520
Then we can start
a music company together.

00:33:25.520 --> 00:33:26.550
You'll be the singer,

00:33:26.550 --> 00:33:27.510
and I'll be the boss.

00:33:27.510 --> 00:33:28.740
You can chase your music dream,

00:33:28.740 --> 00:33:29.920
and I can chase my dream of getting rich.

00:33:29.920 --> 00:33:30.780
What do you say?

00:33:31.900 --> 00:33:33.500
You're going to study music?

00:33:34.010 --> 00:33:36.070
Let me hear you sing a couple of lines.

00:33:36.350 --> 00:33:38.270
I'm just studying it
to understand your world better.

00:33:38.270 --> 00:33:39.160
I'll be the boss,

00:33:39.160 --> 00:33:40.290
and you'll be the singer.

00:33:40.290 --> 00:33:41.820
Come on, sing me something.

00:33:43.180 --> 00:33:45.180
Alright, I'll sing a few lines then.

00:33:48.660 --> 00:33:52.830
♪ Listen to me, through all the hardships
along this long road ♪

00:33:52.830 --> 00:33:58.370
♪ The sun has dried the color
from my youthful face ♪

00:33:59.200 --> 00:33:59.880
How was it?

00:34:00.140 --> 00:34:00.420
♪ Whether in silence or crying out,
it all fades away with time ♪

00:34:00.420 --> 00:34:01.350
Sing a few lines.

00:34:02.810 --> 00:34:04.810
I... I really struck gold this time.

00:34:05.510 --> 00:34:06.830
You must sign with me in the future.

00:34:06.830 --> 00:34:08.120
You can't sign with anyone else.

00:34:08.120 --> 00:34:12.690
♪ What is this ache
that still lingers in my heart? ♪

00:34:12.690 --> 00:34:14.639
Do you remember the exact time?

00:34:14.780 --> 00:34:15.330
I don't.

00:34:15.330 --> 00:34:16.130
♪ Reminding me that I don't deserve
to come through this unscathed ♪

00:34:16.130 --> 00:34:16.920
If we remembered,

00:34:16.920 --> 00:34:18.920
would... Would we have let anything
happen to our son?

00:34:18.920 --> 00:34:20.800
Dehua!

00:34:20.800 --> 00:34:22.260
Dehua!

00:34:22.300 --> 00:34:23.949
Dehua!

00:34:24.090 --> 00:34:25.280
Dehua!

00:34:25.300 --> 00:34:25.360
Dehua!

00:34:25.360 --> 00:34:26.980
[Police]

00:34:26.980 --> 00:34:28.980
Dehua!

00:34:28.980 --> 00:34:30.210
Dehua!

00:34:30.210 --> 00:34:30.820
♪ How many times must I get it wrong? ♪

00:34:30.820 --> 00:34:31.840
Dehua!

00:34:31.840 --> 00:34:32.800
Dehua!

00:34:32.900 --> 00:34:34.150
I'm begging you.

00:34:34.150 --> 00:34:34.190
♪ To make a lie come true ♪

00:34:34.190 --> 00:34:36.659
Please let us see our son one last time!

00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:41.840
Toward the end of last year,

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:44.210
there was a guy who got into
a really heated argument

00:34:44.210 --> 00:34:45.550
with Song—Song Laifu.

00:34:45.550 --> 00:34:47.190
And they were on the verge of
coming to blows.

00:34:47.190 --> 00:34:49.110
He wasn't a guest at the hotel.

00:34:49.110 --> 00:34:50.150
He was...

00:34:50.630 --> 00:34:52.530
I think he was Chen Chunli's nephew.